  1. Average Cycle Time from Requisition to Invoice Payment [time] — minimize (scope: end_to_end)
  2. Average Wait Time Before Invoice Release [time] — minimize (scope: end_to_end)
  3. Purchasing Agent Workload Utilization [utilization] — minimize (scope: end_to_end)

